Description: Open ERP — Open-source Enterprise Resource Planning
 Open ERP is a modern, open-source ERP system built with NestJS, Next.js,
 and PostgreSQL. Features include product management, customer management,
 sales/invoicing, dashboard analytics, and OAuth authentication.
